Subject: [PATCH 19/23] Harness review fixes (generator): one-pattern goal
 scopes, disjoint tenants, role-neutral records, lexical contract

Goal-only tasks get disjoint scopes with exactly one hidden pattern and one in-scope decoy; tenants
have disjoint context ranges and service pools; record ids/titles/source names carry no class signal;
personal source visibility is drawn independently of class; templates obey the deterministic
agreement predicate across patterns (dev bank and the re-sealed holdout bank, sha256 89f4afa8...791a3).
Views carry tenant_id and goal-level outputs for the disclosure check; fault_plan.json records every
injected fault. Engineer: WP2 (claude-sonnet-5-5). Harness tests: 113 passed.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QgQYqiZ8KjrbuXgxGadraA
